  "data": {
    "ruleType": "unit-ability",
    "group": "Hounds of Morkai",
    "summary": "In [your Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase), an enemy unit up to 12\" from this unit can be picked (up to 18\" instead while an attached Lieutenant in Reiver Armour leads this unit). That unit takes a [Battle-shock test](vsdata:core-rule/battle-shock); a **PSYKER** unit subtracts 1 from its result.\n\nOn a fail, it is **Battle-shocked** and also Stunned until [your next Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase). Psychic Attacks by a Stunned unit's models get -1 to Hit.",
